findings.body:
The only rejection assertions are in `.spec.js` files that CI's `node --test` command does not discover. Add this assertion in the adjacent `name.test.js` file:

```js
test('rejects empty names', () => {
  assert.throws(() => normalizeName(''), { message: 'name required' });
});
```

No test asserts the returned name after trimming. Add this assertion in the adjacent `name.test.js` file:

```js
test('trims surrounding whitespace', () => {
  assert.equal(normalizeName('  Ada  '), 'Ada');
});
```
